<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">- Goofa</book>
  <para style="h">3Yohaannisa</para>
  <para style="toc3">3Yoha</para>
  <para style="toc2">3Yohaannisa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yohaannisi Xaafida Heedzantho kiitaa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohaannisi Xaafida</para>
  <para style="mt2">Heedzantho kiitaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohaannisi xaafida heedzantho kiitaa Yesuusa hawaare gidida cimaa Yohaannisi xaafis. I xaafidaykka Gaayoosa giya issi woosa keethaa heemmeyssassa. Xaafey issi baggara Gaayoosi hara ammaneyssata maaddida gisho iya galatees; qassi hara baggara Diyotirafiisa geetettiya woosa keetha halaqa gidanaw koyaa geella uraappe naagettana mela akeekisees.</para>
  <para style="iot">3Yohaannisa kiitaa ayfe qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo qofaa 1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">Gaayoosi galatettis 5-8</para>
  <para style="io1">Diyotirafiisi borettis 9-10</para>
  <para style="io1">Dimexiroosi galatettis 11-12</para>
  <para style="io1">Kuushsha qofaa 13-15</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Taani tumaa dosiya Gaayoosas, taani cimay kiittida kiita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Ha@O 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Roome 16:23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:14">1Qoro 1:14</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ta siiquwaw, neeni ne shemppuwan lo77o de7eyssa ta ereyssada new payyatethi daana melanne ne oothiyabay suurana mela new Xoossaa woossays. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Guutha ammaniyaa asati yidi, ubba wode neeni tuman de7eyssanne ne tumatethabaa markkattida wode taani daro ufayttas. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ta nayti tumatethan de7eyssa si7eyssafe aadhdhidi, tana ufayssiyabay baawa.</para>
  <para style="s">Gaayoosi galatettis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ta siiquwaw, entti new imathe gidikkoka, neeni ammaniyaa asatas ammanthiya ooso oothaasa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Entti ne siiquwabaa woosa keethan markkattoosona. Ha77ika entti biya ogiyan Xoossay doseyssada oothada entta maaddiko lo77o oothaasa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Entti Kiristtoosa sunthaa gisho keyishe, ammanonna asatappe aykkoka ekkibookkonna. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nuuni tuma oosuwa enttara issife oothanaw hayssa mela asata maaddanaw bessees.</para>
  <para style="s">Diyotirafiisanne Dimexiroosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Taani woosa keethatas dabddaabbe xaafas, shin entta halaqaa gidanaw koyaa Diyotirafiisi nuuni geyssa ekkenna. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, taani yaa biya wode I nu bolla odettiya iita odanne I oothida oosuwa odana. I hessi guuxis gidi, nu ishati yaa wode mokkenna. Hari attoshin, entta mokkanaw koyeyssatakka diggidi woosa keethafe kessees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta siiquwaw, lo77obaa daanappe attin iitabaa daanoppa. Lo77obaa oothiya oonikka Xoossaa asi, shin iitabaa oothiya oonikka Xoossaa be7ibeenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Dimexiroosi lo77o asi gideyssa asa ubbay markkattees. Tumay ba huu7en iyabaa markkattees; nukka iyabaa markkattoos; nu markkatethay tuma gideyssa hintte ereeta.</para>
  <para style="s">Wurssetha sarotaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Taani new xaafanaw koyida darobay de7ees, shin qalameninne worqqaten xaafanaw koyikke. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shin taani matara neera gayttanaw qoppays; he wode nuuni odettana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Saroy new gido.</para>
  <para style="p">Ne dabboti nena saro yaagosona. Nu dabbota ubbaa entta sunthaa sunthaa xeegada tana “Saro gis” yaaga.</para>
  <para style="restore">02-Oct-2008@09:05, Backup Description=23-Sep-2008@16:55, Ed Owen -</para>
</usx>
